---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from "../config";
---

<section id="origin" class="py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-[#E5DDD3] bg-[#F4EFEA]/60">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Section Label -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7A7268]">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#C26910]"></span>
      <span>The Genesis Story</span>
      <span class="text-[#D5CCC0]">•</span>
      <span>Dev Log Part 1</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] font-normal text-[#26221E] leading-[1.2] mb-4">
          The one-line change that took <span class="italic font-serif text-[#C26910]">fifty minutes</span>.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed">
          The job was simple: add a hidden <code class="text-xs bg-[#E8E1D7] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[#26221E] font-mono">&lt;meta name="easter-egg" content="hello world"&gt;</code> tag to a one-page Astro site. Any frontier coding model can write this in 2 seconds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFE9E2] border border-[#D5CCC0] text-xs space-y-3 font-mono">
        <div class="text-[#7A7268] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">The Naive Agent Incident</div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-center pt-1">
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3]">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#C26910] font-medium">438</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7A7268] mt-0.5">Model Calls</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3]">
            <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#C26910] font-medium">3,000,000+</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7A7268] mt-0.5">Input Tokens</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#6B635B] text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
          The agent was not stupid—the harness was tripping over its own guardrails, resetting context on every human approval, and attempting TDD on an unrenderable meta tag.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Root Causes vs Solutions Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-10">
      <!-- Trap 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">1. Exploratory Shell Halts</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The agent used <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#26221E]">ls</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#26221E]">cat</code>, and <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#26221E]">grep</code> to inspect the repository. None were on the execution allowlist, so each call paused for human approval. After each pause, the agent forgot its state and re-explored from zero.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          ✓ Phil Solution: Read-only safe allowlist with strict sandbox traversal and symlink guards.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trap 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">2. Amnesia Across Retries</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Each approval, retry, or resume restarted a completely fresh agent session. Nearly all 3 million tokens were repetitive context re-transmissions rather than productive coding.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          ✓ Phil Solution: SQLite checkpointing & state carry-over. Retries receive diffs and summaries, not amnesia.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trap 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">3. Rigid TDD on Static Code</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The orchestrator demanded a failing test before writing code. But markup, copy, and static meta tags do not fail unit test suites, trapping the agent in an infinite red-phase loop.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          ✓ Phil Solution: Distinct "check" tasks verified by commands (e.g. build step), skipping failing-test dogma.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trap 4 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E06C75]"></span>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#26221E] uppercase tracking-wide font-mono">4. Unbounded Model Costs</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          A small website change on Sonnet ran 46 model calls and 1.56M tokens in 90 seconds ($3.17) without hard stops or circuit breakers.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] text-xs text-[#0B7A5A] font-mono">
          ✓ Phil Solution: Hard model call caps, live dollar budgets ($2 default), and prompt caching.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Devlog Link Callout -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#EFE9E2] border border-[#D5CCC0] gap-4">
      <div class="text-xs text-[#4A443D]">
        <span class="font-semibold text-[#26221E]">Read the full architectural breakdown:</span>
        <span class="text-[#7A7268] block sm:inline sm:ml-1">"Building Phil, Part 1: Stop the Waste" covers the root-cause autopsy and the live benchmark harness.</span>
      </div>
      <a
        href={SITE_CONFIG.links.devlogPart1}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#26221E] text-[#FAF8F5] text-xs font-mono font-medium hover:bg-[#3D3732] whitespace-nowrap transition-all"
      >
        <span>Read Part 1 on Devlog</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
